The WeChat compatibility code and synthetic protocol vectors in this
directory were adapted from agent-wechat's wechat-protocol crate at revision
c67b9389da19619f02b812b95fb956dfb0424c4c.
https://github.com/thisnick/agent-wechat/tree/c67b9389da19619f02b812b95fb956dfb0424c4c/packages/native-client-rust/crates/wechat-protocol

Copyright (c) 2026 Nick Yu and contributors. See LICENSE.agent-wechat.

The MMTLS and business certificate pins are public protocol values from the
Linux 4.1.13.26 default configuration, as described in the upstream NOTICE.
The tests use synthetic session data and RFC 5869 test-case 1.
